The directory tests/cel-spec/ holds an unchanged copy of test data, protocol definitions and the language definition of the
Common Expression Language specification (cel-spec), Copyright Google LLC, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(see tests/cel-spec/LICENSE). The data are used by the tests only and are not part of the packages.

The directory tests/cel-policy/ holds an unchanged copy of the conformance test data of the CEL Policy specification (cel-policy,
https://github.com/cel-expr/cel-policy), Copyright Google LLC, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see
tests/cel-policy/LICENSE). The data are used by the tests only and are not part of the packages.

The file tests/Great.Parts.Cel.Conformance/ZoneInfo/zoneinfo.zip is the file lib/time/zoneinfo.zip of Go 1.27.3 (https://go.dev),
compiled from release 2026c of the IANA time zone database (https://www.iana.org/time-zones), which the IANA asserts
to be in the public domain. The file is used by the tests only and is not part of the packages.

The functions bindingValue, newConformanceEnvironments, runConformance and conformanceCase in eng/oracle/conformance.go
are adapted from the functions exprValueToRefValue, init, TestConformance and conformanceTest in
conformance/conformance_test.go of cel-go v0.32.0 (https://github.com/cel-expr/cel-go), Copyright Google LLC, licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE). The directory eng/oracle/ is the reference side of the differential
run and is not part of the packages.

